:Provide userdata for flickr login;
-> Abort;
:Is login successful;
:v1: Is login successful ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:End process after successful login;
stop
else ([v1 = 'No'])
:Choose to try login again;
:v2: Choose to try login again ({Retry, Abort}); <<objectSignal>>
